  "question": {
    "text": "<p>If the solution curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;of the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>y</mi></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;passes through the points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mi>a</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;is equal to</p>",
    "image": null
  },
